storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline (1.0+git20200610-0ddebs3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches : 02_makefile-flags-hardening.patch, removed the x86-
    only options and the -nostartfiles/-nodefaultlibs hack, use
    CPPFLAGS/LDFLAGS and the pkg-config flags of GTK 3 and OpenGL
  * debian/patches : 03_portable-code.patch, main() and exit() instead
    of _start with x86 inline assembly and raw syscalls (builds on ARM),
    shader compile/link errors printed on stderr, removed unused GLU/GLX
    includes
  * debian/rules : cross-compilation (CC), hardening=+all now effective
  * debian/control : Architecture any, libgl-dev instead of libglu-dev,
    Pouët Homepage, improved description
  * debian/copyright : no upstream license found, public-domain
    (probably freeware) instead of GPL-3.0+, removed the Upstream-
    Contact placeholder
  * debian/resources : added the missing icon (the PNG was empty),
    Keywords in the desktop file
  * debian/storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline.6.md : fixed the Pouët link,
    documented the GTK options and the SAMPLES variable
  * debian/upstream/metadata : removed the non-standard References field
  * debian : lintian overrides (pandoc groff-message, upstream
    shader_minifier.exe)

